  page.getByText("Welcome to Dashboard")
).toBeVisible();
```

Telugu: Page lo Welcome to Dashboard text kanipisthundo ledo verify chestham.

## **5.&#x20;**`getByLabel()`

Form element ki associated label batti identify chestham.

HTML:

```
